      "message": "Test: Add P2SH stack size case to taproot test\n\nAdd a feature_taproot spender whose P2SH scriptSig leaves 999 items\non success and 1,000 on failure. The scriptPubKey runs on that stack,\nand its 20-byte push makes the 1,000-item spend exceed the stack size\nlimit. An implementation that only compares the redeemScript hash\naccepts it.\n\nNaming the case lets its dump be added to the script assets.",
